                        <div class="accordion-heading">
                            <span class="accordion-title">
                                <button class="accordion-button icon-angle-right collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse-ad26024e251447eab94e41bb84aab46d-0" aria-controls="collapse-ad26024e251447eab94e41bb84aab46d-0" aria-expanded="false">
                                      GrafTech Advanced Graphite Materials, LLC Class II Landfill Change of Operational Control
                                </button>
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div id="collapse-ad26024e251447eab94e41bb84aab46d-0" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion-ad26024e251447eab94e41bb84aab46d">
                            <div class="accordion-body panel-body" tabindex="0">
                                <div>




    
    
    <div class="tn-rte">
    
        <p>On February 23, 2026, K&amp;B Tennessee Holdings, LLC took over operational control of GrafTech Advanced Graphite Materials, LLC Class II disposal facility at 791 Santa Fe Pike, Columbia, TN 38401 (latitude 35.6381/longitude -87.0578). GrafTech Advanced Graphite Materials, LLC will continue as the permit holder. The Tennessee Department of Environment and Conservation (TDEC) approves the change for the Class II landfill, pursuant to Rule 0400-11-01-.02(6)(a) of Tennessee&#39;s Solid Waste Program Processing and Disposal Regulations as a minor permit modification to the permit for the GrafTech Advanced Graphite Materials, LLC Class II Landfill (IDL600000047).</p>
<p>Paper copies may be reviewed at the TDEC Columbia Environmental Field Office at 1421 Hampshire Pike, Columbia, TN 38401 (931-380-3371), and the TDEC Division of Land Protection Central Office, Davy Crockett Tower, 500 James Robertson Parkway, 7th Floor, Nashville, TN 37243 (615-532-0780). Questions or comments may be directed to the Solid Waste Permitting Manager, Nickolaus Lytle, at the TDEC Central Office at <a href="mailto:Nickolaus.Lytle&#64;tn.gov">Nickolaus.Lytle&#64;tn.gov</a><span style=""> or 615-854-4581.</span></p>

    
    

</div>


    
    
    <div class="tn-linkbuttons"><div>
	
        <div>
            
            
                <a href="/content/dam/tn/environment/solid-waste/documents/solid-waste/remediated/sw_graftech-final-permit-2026.pdf" target="_blank" class="button standard">Final Permit</a>
            
        
            
            
