    <div class="tn-rte">
    
        <p>The Commissioner of the Tennessee Department of Environment and Conservation (TDEC), after a 45-day comment period ending on Wednesday, January 15, 2025, terminated the solid waste disposal facility permit issued to Gateway View, LLC. The facility, identified as Gateway View, LLC Class II Landfill (IDL330000102), is located in Hamilton County, adjacent to and to the north of 2701 Chestnut Street, Chattanooga, Tennessee (latitude 35.034014/longitude -85.323659).</p>

    
    

